# MiMo-V2.6-Pro, two Stations: 20-minute streaming soak of the X3-MTP1 recipe (six tiers + rank-0 routing broadcast +
# the checkpoint's MTP drafter, K=1), picked mechanically by the pre-registered rule, on a fresh boot, then GSM8K-200 on
# the same boot. 2026-10-11 03:21-04:02 PT. Load: C16 streaming, fixed rotation of short natural / knee 192 forced /
# long 1,024 forced prompts from the public pool's slots that no measured bench used, a start nonce and a unique
# cache_salt on every request, T=0; the client runs the full 20 minutes and records every error.
# Excerpt: lines selected verbatim from the raw files named below; hostnames, IPs, GPU UUIDs, network device names and
# file-system paths replaced with <placeholders>. Nothing else edited. Times are Pacific (PT) unless the line says
# otherwise (vLLM's own log stamps are UTC = PT + 7 h).

